  "Name": "Supercow",
  "Overview": "Professor Duriarti, an infamous criminal, recently escaped from prison and seized the farm in Sunny Valley. He captured all of the animals and cloned them! The cloned animals are helping the evil professor carry out his diabolical plan to completely destroy the Earth. The only hope for the world is the daring Supercow!\n\nSupercow is a hilarious dynamic arcade game with an exciting plot for the whole family. If you like Platformers and Runners, you'll definitely enjoy it!",
